**/.git
node_modules
test/
config/local.yaml
config/local.yaml~
config/local.*.yaml
config/firebase-service-account.json
*.log
# Per-deploy overlay secrets must never ship in the image. deploy-dir.js only
# needs config/ + views/ + public/ from deploys/<name>/; the .env (sourced by
# deploy-cloudrun.sh) and any private keys are deploy-time tooling / injected via
# Secret Manager at runtime. Match .env at ANY depth (root + deploys/<name>/) and
# LTI/private keys under deploys/.
**/.env
deploys/**/*.pem
.gcloudignore
